      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "1eacc587-2b42-4821-a797-d6bc500e4f1d",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Foreman signs: The\nheavy parts route\nstays clear. I\nhold the gate",
                "key and a spare at\nthe archive. If\nthe gate freezes,\ncall me; do not",
                "send the load over\nthe roof bridge.\nThe foreman draws\na very heavy",
                "arrow under this."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "932add42-209e-4931-a385-a82ae752b36a",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "c7b86b80-ed3c-46db-a2a7-fac8a57a58a3",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Rivet checks a\npractice packet\nwith four branch\nnames and only\nthree",
                "received marks.\nFrostwick, Candy,\nand Brassworks\nhave signed.\nVelvet",
                "has a sent entry\nbut no received\nmark. Moxie is\nfree to carry a",
                "copy; the lamp\ncard cannot\nconfirm it. Pip\nstarts to count\nthe sent",
                "entry as close\nenough, catches\nhimself, and\nleaves the empty\nbox",
                "visible. Nib would\nrather answer a\nreal check than be\ncongratulated",
                "by assumption."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5a6d5482-313d-49b4-ae44-2bfdd3305c41",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "bc683b23-e6d9-4116-a7d3-92fcd03187ce",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Moxie signs: Stops\nare named, signal\ncards posted,\nbackup copies",
                "ready. If I miss a\nhandoff, Pip gets\nthe truth. She\nadds that the",
                "sled runner now\nturns without\neditorial comment,\nthen crosses out",
                "now to avoid\ntempting fate."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "18b11f3a-f5a9-4436-a9af-3816c1d40a10",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "1602f6bd-ba36-4463-a812-fea9b4804b13",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Rivet signs:\nSpring checked,\nlimit set, seal\nsupply recorded.\nIf a",
                "reading disagrees\nwith the bucket,\nwe investigate the\nreading before",
                "changing the city.\nShe gives you the\nwooden spoon. It\nhas earned a",
                "place in the\npublic tool\nrecord."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e65cdaff-4545-4d59-a306-a0baa296a9ff",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "8b9b1340-5355-43b2-aa71-78041c025d04",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which branch\nshould receive the\nbackup copy in\nthis practice\npacket?",
                "Do not resend\nevery confirmed\ndelivery just to\nlook busy.\nIdentify",
                "the unmatched sent\nentry and use the\nassigned backup\nduty. Moxie",
                "puts her finger\nbeside the three\nsignatures and\nwaits for a",
                "destination, not\nan instruction to\nride around until\nsomebody feels",
                "reassured."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
